# 1.5.20: a voice's filter (its Filter page, after ADSR: par299..302 voice 1's ON, CUTOFF, RESONANCE, ENV). Voice 1's
# key held, echo and reverb off, the garden stopped: open (Off) it peaks over -40 dBFS; On at Cutoff 0 (30 Hz) it is
# all but gone; the page shows the cutoff in Hz
wait 300
tap FX
spin K1 -100
spin K3 -100
tap PLAY
wait 5000
tap ENV
wait 100
tap ENV
wait 100
tap ENV
wait 100
turn SELECT 3 100
expect view 31
expect par299 0
key 7 down
wait 600
peakreset
wait 400
expect peak_db_max >-40
turn K1 1 150
expect par299 1
spin K2 -100
expect par300 0
wait 600
peakreset
wait 400
expect peak_db_max <-60
listen
spin K2 100
expect par300 100
wait 300
said kHz
key 7 up
